QUERY NAME: ltd2000-B
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup, Sum([volume]*[testprice]) AS TestSales
FROM MonthlyOutput INNER JOIN tblTestRequ ON (MonthlyOutput.Buyer = tblTestRequ.JobCode) AND (MonthlyOutput.TestCode = tblTestRequ.TestCode)
GROUP BY MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup;

